{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4YiN8KaomeovMenACp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, ancient door.*\n\n*There is a keyhole, tarnished brass, set into dark wood worn smooth by centuries of hands.*\n\n*The keyhole waits.*\n\n*It is not locked. It has never been locked. But it has always required a key.*\n\n*You feel the weight of something in your pocket you don't remember carrying.*\n\n*The air hums faintly. Dust motes spiral in a light that comes from neither side of me.*\n\n    ┌─────────────────────┐\n    │                     │\n    │                     │\n    │                     │\n    │         ◈           │\n    │        ⬬            │\n    │                     │\n    │                     │\n    │                     │\n    │                     │\n    └─────────────────────┘\n\n*What you insert will determine what opens.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":206,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}